{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"PurchaseOrders\">Purchase Orders</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Lines\">Lines</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"From FromDate Line Lines On Orders PurchaseOrder PurchaseOrders To ToDate View\">The <strong>Purchase Orders - Lines</strong> screen allows you to view individual lines from all purchase orders in one place.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Date Find Is Item Line On Orders PurchaseOrder PurchaseOrders View\">This consolidated view helps you find specific purchase orders based on their line items, track ordered quantities across multiple orders, and analyze purchase patterns.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Line Lines PurchaseOrder\">Accessing Purchase Order Lines</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Line Lines On Orders PurchaseOrder PurchaseOrders To ToDate\">To access the <strong>Purchase Orders - Lines</strong> screen, navigate to the <strong>Purchase Orders</strong> tab.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-shopping-cart text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"PurchaseOrders\">Purchase Orders</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Line Lines On Orders PurchaseOrder PurchaseOrders To ToDate\">Click the <strong>Purchase Orders - Lines</strong> button located in the bottom-right corner.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pb-4 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 p-3 border-b\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"border text-xs rounded py-1 px-2 bg-white border-neutral-300 text-neutral-400\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"PurchaseOrders-Lines\">PurchaseOrders-Lines</span></span></div></div></div><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom To ToDate View\">Customizing Your View</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount And By Code Column Columns Custom Customize Edit EditColumns Hide Is Item ItemCode On Price Tax TaxAmount TaxAmounts To ToDate UnitPrice\">You can customize which columns appear in the table by clicking the <strong>Edit Columns</strong> button. This allows you to show or hide information such as <em>item codes</em>, <em>quantities</em>, <em>unit prices</em>, <em>tax amounts</em>, and more.</p><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Columns Custom LearnMore To ToDate\">Learn more about customizing columns:</span> <a href=\"/guides/edit-columns\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"EditColumns\">Edit columns</span></a></p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"AdvancedQueries By Create Filter Line Lines On Port PurchaseOrder Rent To ToDate\">Use <strong>Advanced Queries</strong> to filter purchase order lines by specific criteria, sort them in different ways, or create summaries for reporting purposes.</p><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"AdvancedQueries LearnMore\">Learn more about advanced queries:</span> <a href=\"/guides/advanced-queries\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"AdvancedQueries\">Advanced Queries</span></a></p>",
